    "titleRomaji": "Kashita Maryoku wa [Ribo Harai] de Kyousei Choushuu ~Youzumi to Party Tsuihou sareta Ore wa, Kawaii Support Yousei to Issho ni Toritateta Maryoku wo Unyou shite Saikyou wo Mezasu.",
    "titleEnglish": "Magic Repo Man: Dumped by My Party, I'll Cash In With a Cute Support Fairy to Become the Strongest!",
